#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Li juru mudelli salvati għal:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Mudell wieħed biss tal-wiċċ huwa rreġistrat. Id-dawl jibdel kif wiċċek "
"iħares lejn il-kamera, għalhekk mudell wieħed jista 'jfalli filgħaxija taħt "
"il-lampi (jew fid-dawl tal-jum). Żid it-tieni mudell irreġistrat f'dawl "
"differenti biex iżżomm il-ftuħ affidabbli fi kwalunkwe ħin tal-ġurnata."

